<title>USA: Watson Pharmaceuticals completes merger.</title>
<headline>Watson Pharmaceuticals completes merger.</headline>
<dateline>CORONA, Calif. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Watson Pharmaceuticals Inc said Friday that Oclassen stockholders approved the merger of Watson and Oclassen Pharmaceuticals</p>
<p>The transaction was completted February 27, through the issuance of 3,857,000 shares of Watson Pharmaceuticals common stock in exchange for all of the outstanding capital stock of Oclassen and rights to acquire capital stock of Oclassen, and will be accounted for as a &quot;pooling of interests&quot; and a tax-free reorganization.  Going forward, Oclassen will operate as a wholly owned subsidiary of Watson.</p>
</text>
